        <mxCell id="p4_c38" value="exchange (client-x509)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1173" y="244" width="129" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_c39" value="&lt;b&gt;Notlar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Varsayılan deny: tanımsız yol 404. /bff/* ve /partner/* ext-authz'den geçer; /public/* (yalnız GET) ve /realms/* ext-authz'siz iç gateway'e gider.&lt;br&gt;• Kanal NodePort'ları: web 30446, mobile 30447, partner 30448, branch 30449. F1 kuralı yalnız edge IP'sinden bu portlara izin verir.&lt;br&gt;• İç backend: Service/Endpoints 172.18.0.10:30444 (gw-internal NodePort), BackendTLSPolicy hostname gw-internal.&lt;br&gt;• ext-authz hata yanıtları JSON gövdeyle döner (error, error_description, layer: dmz-ext-authz).&lt;br&gt;• Tracing: gateway'ler ListenerPolicy ile OTLP/gRPC span gönderir (Tempo, 30317). traceparent ve x-request-id ext-authz'e iletilir." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="400" width="1200" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
