        <mxCell id="p11_c81" value="" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p11_c79" target="p11_c80"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c82" value="17. 200" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="998" width="178" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c83" value="KONTROLLER: K1 dış token RS256 imzası, iss, aud, exp ve channel=mobile. K2 IdP yalnız azp=mobile-app ve channel=mobile kabul eder.&lt;br&gt;K3 İç token cihaz anahtarına bağlı değildir (DPoP kaldırıldı, D-12); güven kısa ömür ve DMZ→iç mTLS ile sağlanır. K4 geçersiz dış token iç ağa girmez.&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: cihaz bağlaması ve attestation (App Attest / Play Integrity) yok; ext-authz replika &gt; 1; mobile-app directAccessGrants kapalı (lab'da açık)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1088" width="1270" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c84" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. GET /bff/accounts | [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /bff/accounts  Authorization: Bearer &lt;dış token&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. 2. TLS re-encrypt | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 2. TLS re-encrypt&lt;br&gt;3. 3. ext-authz | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 3. ext-authz: X-Dmz-Channel=mobile, Authorization, Host&lt;br&gt;4. 4. RS256 token doğrula; channel=mobile, iss, aud | [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 4. RS256 token doğrula; channel=mobile, iss, aud, exp&lt;br&gt;5. 5. token exchange | [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 5. token exchange (mTLS: CN=dmz-exchange-mobile), subject = dış token&lt;br&gt;6. 6. /token | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [IdP]: 6. /token (XFCC: dmz-exchange-mobile)&lt;br&gt;7. 7. IdP | [IdP] kendi içinde: 7. IdP: subject imzası, azp=mobile-app, channel=mobile; cnf kaldır; yeniden imzala&lt;br&gt;8. 8. Standart exchange | [IdP] kendi içinde: 8. Standart exchange: iç JWT üret&lt;br&gt;9. 9. iç JWT | [IdP] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 9. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;10. 10. iç JWT | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 10. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;11. 11. 200 + Authorization | [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 11. 200 + Authorization: Bearer &lt;iç JWT&gt;&lt;br&gt;12. GET /bff/accounts | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 12. GET /bff/accounts + iç JWT (mTLS)&lt;br&gt;13. 13. RBAC | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [BFF app-bff]: 13. RBAC (mobile), forward&lt;br&gt;14. 14. 200  service=bff channel=mobile | [BFF app-bff] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 14. 200  service=bff channel=mobile&lt;br&gt;15. 15. 200 | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 15. 200&lt;br&gt;16. 16. 200 | [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 16. 200&lt;br&gt;17. 17. 200 | [HAProxy] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 17. 200" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1210" width="1270" height="298" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c85" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1522" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
