        <mxCell id="p14_c123" value="" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p14_c121" target="p14_c122"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p14_c124" value="26. 200 token yanıtı" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="1384" width="178" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p14_c125" value="KONTROLLER: K1 Authorization Code + PKCE (S256). K2 redirect_uri tam eşleşme. K3 login trafiği ext-authz'den geçmez, kimlik yolu DMZ→iç mTLS ile korunur.&lt;br&gt;K4 MFA (acr=2) zorunluluğu planlı. K5 iç token bu akışta üretilmez; yalnız API çağrısında exchange ile üretilir.&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: hedef web için BFF oturum deseni (token sunucuda, tarayıcıda HttpOnly çerez, D-10). redirect_uri sıkı; brute-force koruması; MFA zorunlu." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1474" width="1080" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p14_c126" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. GET /realms/bank/.../auth | [Kullanıcı] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /realms/bank/.../auth?code_challenge=S256(...)&lt;br&gt;2. 2. /realms/* login route | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 2. /realms/* login route (ext-authz YOK)&lt;br&gt;3. 3. /realms/* → iç gateway | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 3. /realms/* → iç gateway (mTLS, F2)&lt;br&gt;4. 4. IdP auth endpoint | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [IdP]: 4. IdP auth endpoint&lt;br&gt;5. 5. 200 parola formu | [IdP] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 5. 200 parola formu&lt;br&gt;6. 6. 200 | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 6. 200&lt;br&gt;7. 7. 200 | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 7. 200&lt;br&gt;8. 8. 200 parola formu | [HAProxy] -&gt; [Kullanıcı]: 8. 200 parola formu&lt;br&gt;9. 10. re-encrypt | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 10. re-encrypt&lt;br&gt;10. 11. /realms/* | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 11. /realms/* (mTLS, F2)&lt;br&gt;11. 12. kimlik doğrulama | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [IdP]: 12. kimlik doğrulama&lt;br&gt;12. 13. OTP / push doğrulama | [IdP] -&gt; [MFA sağlayıcı]: 13. OTP / push doğrulama&lt;br&gt;13. 14. MFA onayı | [MFA sağlayıcı] -&gt; [IdP]: 14. MFA onayı (acr=2)&lt;br&gt;14. 15. 302 Location | [IdP] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 15. 302 Location: redirect_uri?code=&lt;kod&gt;&lt;br&gt;15. 16. 302 | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 16. 302&lt;br&gt;16. 17. 302 | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 17. 302&lt;br&gt;17. 18. 302 → redirect_uri | [HAProxy] -&gt; [Kullanıcı]: 18. 302 → redirect_uri&lt;br&gt;18. 20. re-encrypt | [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 20. re-encrypt&lt;br&gt;19. 21. /realms/* | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 21. /realms/* (mTLS, F2)&lt;br&gt;20. 22. code + code_verifier doğrula | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [IdP]: 22. code + code_verifier doğrula (S256)&lt;br&gt;21. 23. dış access token + refresh token | [IdP] -&gt; [kgateway internal]: 23. dış access token + refresh token&lt;br&gt;22. 24. 200 | [kgateway internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 24. 200&lt;br&gt;23. 25. 200 | [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 25. 200&lt;br&gt;24. 26. 200 token yanıtı | [HAProxy] -&gt; [Kullanıcı]: 26. 200 token yanıtı" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1596" width="1080" height="410" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p14_c127" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2020" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
